.SH NAME
tk-note-review-approve - Write + index one captured note


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtk note review approve  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Write + index one captured note


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for approve


